ank God.","Attachments":[],"Id":1826320,"PostDate":1389804750,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes. I know. I signed the contract before they did that thank God. <br \/>Yes. I know. I signed the contract before they did that thank God. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenni_lee2@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.14.163.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389790444,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cottagegirl","Id":276105,"Name":"cottagegirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9073632c5b8fff31660e92cc86167363","RawContent":"I should be receiving pictures of the other gazebo. I will post them when I do! Their big package is still very reasonable and they have the lowest cost for the additional guest fee. It&#039;s $20 additional fee per guest over 20. \nLucky!!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1826321,"PostDate":1389804916,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I should be receiving pictures of the other gazebo. I will post them when I do! Their big package is still very reasonable and they have the lowest cost for the additional guest fee. It's $20 additional fee per guest over 20. <br \/>Lucky!!!!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janina27@live.com","IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389725855,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276085.jpg?_r=1389741323","PhotoWidth":118,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2bMrsClark","Id":276085,"Name":"Soon2bMrsClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.67.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ab20d483a15d9fb0125b83c900315c8","RawContent":"Do they only have 2 gazebos?  I thought they had 3? I would also like to see the different options of decorating them.  Have you heard anything about that?","Attachments":[],"Id":1826323,"PostDate":1389804926,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Do they only have 2 gazebos?  I thought they had 3? I would also like to see the different options of decorating them.  Have you heard anything about that?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenni_lee2@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.14.163.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389790444,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cottagegirl","Id":276105,"Name":"cottagegirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dcfcd67ee29b71800742f0df4e9a1cf1","RawContent":"They have 3. I&#039;m waiting to see the other pictures.","Attachments":[],"Id":1826325,"PostDate":1389805101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                They have 3. I'm waiting to see the other pictures. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janina27@live.com","IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389725855,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276085.jpg?_r=1389741323","PhotoWidth":118,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2bMrsClark","Id":276085,"Name":"Soon2bMrsClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.67.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"221795b132351fe7c681ecc224ffd94c","RawContent":"Is your planner Laura?","Attachments":[],"Id":1826327,"PostDate":1389805228,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Is your planner Laura?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenni_lee2@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.14.163.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389790444,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cottagegirl","Id":276105,"Name":"cottagegirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe408735b8074645aa146e274881a267","RawContent":"Yea. But I think it&#039;s a different planner once you get to the resort.","Attachments":[],"Id":1826426,"PostDate":1389817212,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yea. But I think it's a different planner once you get to the resort. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janina27@live.com","IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389725855,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276085.jpg?_r=1389741323","PhotoWidth":118,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2bMrsClark","Id":276085,"Name":"Soon2bMrsClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.102.197.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1389818615,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2968d023924df024fdf840bcc655256","RawContent":"So I am a little behind. I have not selected a package yet. I paid the deposit to hold the date and location. When you selected your package did you pay upfront or have to add an additional deposit ?\n\n\n\n\nLaura is my contact also","Attachments":[],"Id":1826430,"PostDate":1389818580,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So I am a little behind. I have not selected a package yet. I paid the deposit to hold the date and location. When you selected your package did you pay upfront or have to add an additional deposit ?<br><br><br><br>\nLaura is my contact also\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Stewarjs2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.102.197.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385314637,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275292.jpg?_r=1387054671","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bigleap35","Id":275292,"Name":"Bigleap35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1389818667,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c68439b5c437c9ab9314bec34f58fb40","RawContent":"I believe you just pay the deposit. If I&#039;m not mistaken after you pick a package they will send you a contract to sign. You maybe able to split the cost. Pay half and half.\nI&#039;m waiting to finalize all of that myself this week.","Attachments":[],"Id":1826431,"PostDate":1389818688,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I believe you just pay the deposit. If I'm not mistaken after you pick a package they will send you a contract to sign. You maybe able to split the cost. Pay half and half.<br \/>I'm waiting to finalize all of that myself this week. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janina27@live.com","IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389725855,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276085.jpg?_r=1389741323","PhotoWidth":118,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2bMrsClark","Id":276085,"Name":"Soon2bMrsClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.102.197.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"462e05f9f1f1a72591c565c0e3f5b3a0","RawContent":"I am soo excited to see other Royalton brides I was getting a little jealous of the other resorts.","Attachments":[],"Id":1826433,"PostDate":1389818824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am soo excited to see other Royalton brides I was getting a little jealous of the other resorts.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Stewarjs2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.102.197.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385314637,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275292.jpg?_r=1387054671","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bigleap35","Id":275292,"Name":"Bigleap35","IsOnline":fa