957d251c7d0b47","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;Now Resorts is taking over the NH Real Arena Resort.....Anyone here anything about it, or have any info? &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m considering this resort for my wedding after the take over&amp;nbsp;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_130075832611329\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/confused.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1421013,"PostDate":1300744418,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0Now Resorts is taking over the NH Real Arena Resort.....Anyone here anything about it, or have any info? \u00a0I'm considering this resort for my wedding after the take over\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_130075832611329\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/confused.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>monica wasser<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"daizey128@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297123055,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236509.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":253,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"moniwoni","Id":236509,"Name":"moniwoni","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60331,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0a11a7d2f36e41be186b0efe1c4d6a4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; IT&#039;S THE NOW LARIMAR...ooops&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; http:\/\/www.nowresorts.com\/larimar\/&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1421063,"PostDate":1300749437,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> IT'S THE NOW LARIMAR...ooops<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.nowresorts.com\/larimar\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.nowresorts.com\/larimar\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>monica wasser<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"daizey128@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297123055,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236509.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":253,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"moniwoni","Id":236509,"Name":"moniwoni","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60331,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f68c2d45d0169ee27eeec18b2898d8cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I don&#039;t have any info on it but I just wanted to comment.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; It does look beautiful but things like this make me nervous.&amp;nbsp; Sometimes guests, brides, etc. get \"lost\" in transition and then things that are supposed to be done for the takeover by a certain time end up taking longer than expected which may or may not affect your wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I would be a little bit hesitant to pick a resort that would be going through a transition around the time of my wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; When is your date?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1421158,"PostDate":1300785697,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I don't have any info on it but I just wanted to comment.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It does look beautiful but things like this make me nervous.\u00a0 Sometimes guests, brides, etc. get \"lost\" in transition and then things that are supposed to be done for the takeover by a certain time end up taking longer than expected which may or may not affect your wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would be a little bit hesitant to pick a resort that would be going through a transition around the time of my wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> When is your date?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deanna.cubellis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299854632,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237692.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Aphrodite","Id":237692,"Name":"Aphrodite","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60331,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a89f09449c7ab384b0e743f276f7f184","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m actually in the process of booking my wedding date here. I have the contact info for the WC and can help with any questions you might have. Just let me know what you need =)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; jb&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1421748,"PostDate":1300835346,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm actually in the process of booking my wedding date here. I have the contact info for the WC and can help with any questions you might have. Just let me know what you need =)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> jb<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaz_fugurl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295300182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235671.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":212,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jbmarch2012","Id":235671,"Name":"jbmarch2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","Is