ml>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Do you know if they will allow an outside photographer?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_e_willis@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1296181683,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236107.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Copswife2012","Id":236107,"Name":"Copswife2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60331,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c60d7bdb39603124291993f7fe9bd933","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yes they allow it, you just have to&amp;nbsp;purchase a day pass to bring him\/her in. I think it costs $70 pp.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Copswife2012&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; Do you know if they will allow an outside photographer?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1421945,"PostDate":1300876571,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yes they allow it, you just have to\u00a0purchase a day pass to bring him\/her in. I think it costs $70 pp.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>Copswife2012<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Do you know if they will allow an outside photographer?<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaz_fugurl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295300182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235671.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":212,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jbmarch2012","Id":235671,"Name":"jbmarch2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60331,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2366df8541a0aa7fa2dab4200d18e327","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Are you having trouble getting them to lock in rates that far in advance? &amp;nbsp;That&#039;s my issue which is why I may consider having it Nov 2011. &amp;nbsp;My TA is trying to see if she can get me the special rates there having now for next year. &amp;nbsp;Can u send me the WC info please=) . &amp;nbsp;So happy to hear someone else is booking there!!! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m still not 100% but it&#039;s a top contender.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1422780,"PostDate":1300969125,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Are you having trouble getting them to lock in rates that far in advance? \u00a0That's my issue which is why I may consider having it Nov 2011. \u00a0My TA is trying to see if she can get me the special rates there having now for next year. \u00a0Can u send me the WC info please=) . \u00a0So happy to hear someone else is booking there!!! \u00a0I'm still not 100% but it's a top contender.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>monica wasser<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"daizey128@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297123055,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236509.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":253,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"moniwoni","Id":236509,"Name":"moniwoni","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60331,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8289b580491dff552cf4bbee4cbceb78","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; \n I know! It would definitely be nice to get the $98 pnpp! But So far the best I got for next year is $116 pnpp... But they do have a booking special where every 6th room is free, I&#039;m not sure how many you are trying to book but we would be booking 20 and have decided to just divide the 3 rooms free among the guests to bring down their cost a bit. But hey, if you can lock those special rates in let me know!!! &lt;span alt=\":D\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This is the general e-mail for weddings&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; Are you having trouble getting them to lock in rates that far in advance? &amp;nbsp;That&#039;s my issue which is why I may consider having it Nov 2011. &amp;nbsp;My TA is trying to see if she can get me the special rates there having now for next year. &amp;nbsp;Can u send me the WC info please=) . &amp;nbsp;So happy to hear someone else is booking there!!! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m still not 100% but it&#039;s a top contender.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/blockquote&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1422951,"PostDate":1300980456,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> I know! It would definitely be nice to get the $98 pnpp! But So far the best I got for next year is $116 pnpp... But they do have a booking special where every 6th room is free, I'm not sure how many you are trying to book but we would be booking 20 and have decided to just divide the 3 rooms free among the guests to bring down their cost a bit. But hey, if you can lock those special rates in let me know!!! <span alt=\":D\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This is the general e-mail for weddings\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Are you having trouble getting them to lock in rates that far in advance? \u00a0That's my issue which is why I may consider having it Nov 2011. \u00a0My TA is trying to see if she can get me the special rates there having now for next year. \u00a0Can u send me the WC info please=) . \u00a0So happy to hear someone else is booking there!!! \u00a0I'm still not 100% but it's a top contender.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaz_fugurl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295300182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235671.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":212,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jbmarch2012","Id":235671,"Name":"jbmarch2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60331,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68907a682558ba39aa91be726c0ae262","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; moniwoni,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; just wanted to make sure you got my email with the info about the resort.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; jb&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1424045,"PostDate":1301135149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> moniwoni,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> just wanted to make sure you got my email with the info about the resort.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> jb<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaz_fugurl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295300182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235671.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":212,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jbmarch2012","Id":235671,"Name":"jbmarch2012","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"60331","Title":" \"New Resort Opening May 1 2011\"  NOW LARIMAR ~ PUNTA CANA   ","LastPostDate":1437597842},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2001,"TotalPages":201,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":2000},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
