Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.37.246.235","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c75c4ee1b8f70701e6e61bf2c4f27cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Anyone getting married at Now Larimar in 2015? &amp;nbsp;I am newly engaged and ready to start planning! &amp;nbsp;Right now I am heavily leaning towards Now Larimar for a May 2015 wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855399,"PostDate":1402876819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Anyone getting married at Now Larimar in 2015? \u00a0I am newly engaged and ready to start planning! \u00a0Right now I am heavily leaning towards Now Larimar for a May 2015 wedding.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brandy.blevin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.37.246.235","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1342956399,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258172.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BrandyMarie1023","Id":258172,"Name":"BrandyMarie1023","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"582cc7a2fa3c1f47a955ebba71189381","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome to BDW!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I would highly recommend that you search through the forums and do some reading. I can almost guaranteee that whatever you&#039;re looking for has already been asked and answered here. Just to to the search bar at the top and type in your resort. There will likely be several forum threads that pop up. You&#039;ll find everyone here more than willing to share and happy to pass on their tips and advice so definitely get into readying mode and have fun!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855496,"PostDate":1402930835,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome to BDW!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would highly recommend that you search through the forums and do some reading. I can almost guaranteee that whatever you're looking for has already been asked and answered here. Just to to the search bar at the top and type in your resort. There will likely be several forum threads that pop up. You'll find everyone here more than willing to share and happy to pass on their tips and advice so definitely get into readying mode and have fun!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b067a4f7d6e8e6665cee9e290d6b0c7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @Brandymarie1013! I am also getting married in May 2015 at Now Larimar.&amp;nbsp; Have you booked yet?&amp;nbsp; I am still trying to decide between reception spots.&amp;nbsp; Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856828,"PostDate":1403647690,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @Brandymarie1013! I am also getting married in May 2015 at Now Larimar.\u00a0 Have you booked yet?\u00a0 I am still trying to decide between reception spots.\u00a0 Happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388150678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.133.139.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcd7ca824a1da1fe831fa64510ca93f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am all booked for Feb 2015, and beginning the planning process now! I read through a lot of the posts for 2014 brides and there is some really good information in that forum. But I hope that we have some other 2015 brides that start to post on this feed as well.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860199,"PostDate":1405527501,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am all booked for Feb 2015, and beginning the planning process now! I read through a lot of the posts for 2014 brides and there is some really good information in that forum. But I hope that we have some other 2015 brides that start to post on this feed as well.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsdtaylor910@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.133.139.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1378119619,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273127.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Drnelly910","Id":273127,"Name":"Drnelly910","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.121.201.136","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd2af21edfa1d3e3e0dc5c3affa42939","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Now Larimar is a beautiful resort. It&#039;s not TOO big which is perfect for it giving a more intimate feeling and has gorgeous grounds! You can see a full wedding we did at Now right here: {&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-emily-matt\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-emily-matt\/&lt;\/a&gt;} along with their romance session on the Now beach: &lt;a&gt;{http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/punta-cana-sunrise-engagement-session-emily-matt\/}&lt;\/a&gt; Enjoy! &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;amp; I&#039;m happy to answer any questions you may have on anything at all!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy planning your weddings beauties!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;XO&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mel&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860732,"PostDate":1405698246,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Now Larimar is a beautiful resort. It's not TOO big which is perfect for it giving a more intimate feeling and has gorgeous grounds! You can see a full wedding we did at Now right here: {<a href='http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-emily-matt\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.shoeboxph...ing-emily-matt\/<\/a>} along with their romance session on the Now beach: <a>{http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/punta-cana-sunrise-engagement-session-emily-matt\/}<\/a> Enjoy! <\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>& I'm happy to answer any questions you may have on anything at all!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Enjoy planning your weddings beauties!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>XO<\/p>\n<p>Mel<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<div><img src=\"https:\/\/lh6.googleusercontent.com\/-lGVqCU0N1AM\/U8QTGSsNQLI\/AAAAAAAAAG8\/c2eMfpfUb98\/w900-h34-no\/Separator.png\" alt=\"Separator.png\"><\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.shoebox.photography'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh4.googleusercontent.com\/-JdsF2YCETJ4\/U8QTHoSz6AI\/AAAAAAAAAHI\/Gs0gmfxN6yg\/w900-h208-no\/Signature+Image.png\" alt=\"Signature+Image.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/blog\/'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\/-rTlCZicS2NI\/U8QTLPp1YfI\/AAAAAAAAAHw\/Qvck2GcSFVU\/s32-no\/Blog.png\" alt=\"Blog.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ShoeBoxPhotography.ca'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh4.googleusercontent.com\/-uxRk32WMQoc\/U8QTLKwy4DI\/AAAAAAAAAH4\/pRWW6OhEkKM\/s32-no\/Facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/plus.google.com\/+ShoeBoxPhotographyCoquitlam'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh5.googleusercontent.com\/-TMGooLPDMy4\/U8QTLLPlm0I\/AAAAAAAAAHs\/w6eJlxhiJAU\/s32-no\/Google%252B.png\" alt=\"Google%252B.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/instagram.com\/shoeboxphoto'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\/-ajJLgsJxa04\/U8QTLbzmXVI\/AAAAAAAAAHo\/NrvofXeyI7Q\/s32-no\/Instagram.png\" alt=\"Instagram.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/sbxphotography'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh5.googleusercontent.com\/-vJoZFBKe3io\/U8QTLmkl-RI\/AAAAAAAAAHg\/WIjIkkyfuP8\/s32-no\/Pinterest.png\" alt=\"Pinterest.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.twitter.com\/ShoeBox_Photo'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh5.googleusercontent.com\/-7rLyHZHERXc\/U8QTL3MkRzI\/AAAAAAAAAHk\/L-CoCkcA8rw\/s32-no\/Twitter.png\" alt=\"Twitter.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:hello@shoebox.photography?subject=BDW%20Message'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh4.googleusercontent.com\/-hOjdlMEtFy4\/U8QTGcV0rrI\/AAAAAAAAAHA\/_nX5zB9A7z0\/w264-h43-no\/Let%2527s+Chat+arrow+and+button.png\" alt=\"Let%2527s+Chat+arrow+and+button.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"hello@shoebox.photography","IpAddress":"181.37.93.247","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1401789998,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278221.png?_r=1402507848","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ShoeBoxPhotography","Id":278221,"Name":"ShoeBoxPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e42a24f9527318bc3b4300b7faa7ede7","RawContent":"Hey all, this is my top contender for our wedding in oct. 2015, I was just wondering about people&#039;s impressions of the resort?  I spend too much time on trip advisor and their reviews stress me out.  ARe the rooms nice at this resort? Will everyone be happy if they are at the preferred club level?  I&#039;m trying to not be too expensive so more can come, but not trashy!  Our biggest issue is the beach, I love gorgeous beaches, live by siesta key, is it nice there?  Thanks all, any advice is appreciated!","Attachments":[],"Id":1861355,"PostDate":1405977051,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey all, this is my top contender for our wedding in oct. 2015, I was just wondering about people's impressions of the resort?  I spend too much time on trip advisor and their reviews stress me out.  ARe the rooms nice at this resort? Will everyone be happy if they are at the preferred club level?  I'm trying to not be too expensive so more can come, but not trashy!  Our biggest issue is the beach, I love gorgeous beaches, live by siesta key, is it nice there?  Thanks all, any advice is appreciated!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.249.154.117","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"559c2f91510b4f7b65cd37a57b7bf250","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HI Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have been having a hard time deciding on a resort for my August 2015 wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Would love for any information from past brides. I am leaning towards Now Larimar because I think their wedding packages have the best offers.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Would Appreciate any help...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862688,"PostDate":1406489938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HI Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>I have been having a hard time deciding on a resort for my August 2015 wedding.<\/p>\n<p>Would love for any information from past brides. I am leaning towards Now Larimar because I think their wedding packages have the best offers.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Would Appreciate any help...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gigglescastellanos24@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.143.62.227","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399994934,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277953.jpg?_r=1400073269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gigglescastellanos24","Id":277953,"Name":"gigglescastellanos24","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e19952f66ae788a30d9b1e6dcead7ca6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello all!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fiance and I just got engaged last week and are booking at the Now Larimar for May 25, 2015.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have asked for a beach wedding, and a poolside sit down dinner reception. &amp;nbsp;I am a little concerned about some of the additional costs (like decor - they really bare bones it) but we only get married once so we&#039;ll have it all figured out! &amp;nbsp;I know they said they don&#039;t charge for programs or favours, so I might try to make our programs pretty enough to hang on the chairs (ahem, decor) and our centrepieces to actually be small favours for the wedding reception (like candle holders or something). &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I do have to say I am EXTREMELY impressed dealing with Michelle over the past couple days. &amp;nbsp;She has given me prompt response to lots of questions (normally within an hour or two).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have been to this resort before, when it was still the NH Real Arena - the grounds are gorgeous, as is the beach. &amp;nbsp;I am so excited I could find an affordable option for my guests (its really no more than what we would pay for a good beach in the Mayan), that is gorgeous for the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m open to sharing ideas, questions etc!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1863028,"PostDate":1406637039,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello all!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance and I just got engaged last week and are booking at the Now Larimar for May 25, 2015.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have asked for a beach wedding, and a poolside sit down dinner reception. \u00a0I am a little concerned about some of the additional costs (like decor - they really bare bones it) but we only get married once so we'll have it all figured out! \u00a0I know they said they don't charge for programs or favours, so I might try to make our programs pretty enough to hang on the chairs (ahem, decor) and our centrepieces to actually be small favours for the wedding reception (like candle holders or something). \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I do have to say I am EXTREMELY impressed dealing with Michelle over the past couple days. \u00a0She has given me prompt response to lots of questions (normally within an hour or two).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have been to this resort before, when it was still the NH Real Arena - the grounds are gorgeous, as is the beach. \u00a0I am so excited I could find an affordable option for my guests (its really no more than what we would pay for a good beach in the Mayan), that is gorgeous for the wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm open to sharing ideas, questions etc!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelann25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406568944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279198.jpg?_r=1415031085","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAT2015","Id":279198,"Name":"KAT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f8d877d5faadc00ce32d2b929009daae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Cwright\"] Hi Cwright - I see that you&#039;re getting married in May at Now Larimar - thats what we will be booking too. &amp;nbsp;What day?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1863043,"PostDate":1406639534,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275744\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275744-cwright\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Cwright<\/span><\/a> Hi Cwright - I see that you're getting married in May at Now Larimar - thats what we will be booking too. \u00a0What day?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelann25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406568944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279198.jpg?_r=1415031085","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAT2015","Id":279198,"Name":"KAT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48963d5117fb9dfe45ade5b0c521096d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello all,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are confirmed and finally done with the major details for our May 1 2015 @ NOW!! We have been engaged since April 20, 2013 and i&#039;ve been planning since April 21, 2013&amp;nbsp; :D&amp;nbsp; lol. We visited in September to meet with our coordinator and view the property. I can try to answer whatever questions you may have!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864626,"PostDate":1407243542,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello all,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are confirmed and finally done with the major details for our May 1 2015 @ NOW!! We have been engaged since April 20, 2013 and i've been planning since April 21, 2013\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0 lol. We visited in September to meet with our coordinator and view the property. I can try to answer whatever questions you may have!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375998669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":206,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
