vetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sorry if this is a repeat thread ... I tried searching but couldn't find a thread with exactly this question: <br \/> <br \/> Has anyone ever ordered a flower girl tutu from <a href='http:\/\/weddingtutu.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>WeddingTutu.com<\/a>? <br \/> <br \/> I want to order one for my flower girl but I'm always wary about ordering off the net from a company I don't know ... and I hate not being able to see the product before I buy it!! I know ... I'm anal. <br \/> <br \/> Thanks ladies.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Automotive Journalist Extraordinaire<\/i><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/drivingmsmiranda.wordpress.com\/\">Driving MsMiranda's Blog<\/a><\/strong><br><br><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/blissfulmsmirandas-mirandas-planning-madness-pic-heavy-42210\/\">Miranda's Planning Thread ~~<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f55\/my-montreal-bd-shoot-pics-41285\/\">Miranda's BD Shoot<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/mirandas-non-pro-melia-cayo-guillermo-wedding-ttd-pics-43309\/\">~~ Miranda's Non-Pro Pics ~~<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/mirandas-cuba-melia-cayo-guillermo-pro-pic-teasers-alain-doss-photography-46525\/\">Miranda's Pro Pics ~~<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' hre