!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I was gonna say the same thing, and you wouldn't have to worry b\/c she is right here! So it's not like you are buying it from a completely random stranger!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"betsyrohr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.103.44.199","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1193717520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207887.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Betsy","Id":207887,"Name":"Betsy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31430,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"170b88d3419abe87ab3ad9b84e031a86","RawContent":"I saw flower girl tutu&#039;s at our local bridal show and they are so cute! I have been to Nicole&#039;s website and her tutu&#039;s are so pretty and she looks really affordable!","Attachments":[],"Id":595066,"PostDate":1234907323,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I saw flower girl tutu's at our local bridal show and they are so cute! I have been to Nicole's website and her tutu's are so pretty and she looks really affordable!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"desireemeg84@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Memb