{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b818097de6a516ec93b2fd16860468f","RawContent":"As Alyssa stated, this is correct. This forum is just getting so big, which is great in so many ways, but it&#039;s making it harder for Tammy and the moderators to manage on a daily basis. We know we will lose some great vendors, but this is a step that we need to take to be able to keep the forum running.","Attachments":[],"Id":656842,"PostDate":1239894012,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                As Alyssa stated, this is correct. This forum is just getting so big, which is great in so many ways, but it's making it harder for Tammy and the moderators to manage on a daily basis. We know we will lose some great vendors, but this is a step that we need to take to be able to keep the forum running.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161378480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70dee0a9dc3c0cd109fbbe940d8ad04a","RawContent":"Thank you Alyssa,\n \n Okay, so I did get it right, I&#039;m clear on compulsory pay for ALL vendors, that&#039;s clear now.\n \n What&#039;s still not quite clear is if plain &amp;quot;vendors&amp;quot; need to pay $150, then how much does a &amp;quot;platinum&amp;quot; vendor have to pay?, I seem to get lost on the fine print...lol.\n \n Thanks again!\n marTin\n \n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Alyssa&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Martin,&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;strong&gt;Yes that is correct. ALL Vendors will now have to be paid members to participate on the forum.&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;strong&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":658255,"PostDate":1239983789,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you Alyssa,<br \/> <br \/> Okay, so I did get it right, I'm clear on compulsory pay for ALL vendors, that's clear now.<br \/> <br \/> What's still not quite clear is if plain \"vendors\" need to pay $150, then how much does a \"platinum\" vendor have to pay?, I seem to get lost on the fine print...lol.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks again!<br \/> marTin<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Alyssa<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\"><strong>Martin,<\/strong><br \/> <strong>Yes that is correct. ALL Vendors will now have to be paid members to participate on the forum.<\/strong><br \/> <strong>Thanks!<\/strong><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"unikphoto@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1200425040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208244.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"unikphoto","Id":208244,"Name":"unikphoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b0fa983efe97dd81172a9a484b76bab","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;unikphoto&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thank you Alyssa,\n \n Okay, so I did get it right, I&#039;m clear on compulsory pay for ALL vendors, that&#039;s clear now.\n \n What&#039;s still not quite clear is if plain &amp;quot;vendors&amp;quot; need to pay $150, then how much does a &amp;quot;platinum&amp;quot; vendor have to pay?, I seem to get lost on the fine print...lol.\n \n Thanks again!\n marTin&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi Martin,\n \n Please see the rules for platinum vendors copied from above, note the request to send an email about rates and availability.\n &lt;strong&gt;Platinum vendor:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;must pay for button ad (email &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com\"&gt;ads@bestdestinationwedding.com&lt;\/a&gt; for rates and available spots)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;get added to the &amp;quot;BDW Platinum Vendor Directory&amp;quot;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;are allowed to put their website &amp;amp; blog links, 1 pic, &amp;amp; info in their siggy&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;get to run 3 promos\/ads in vendor marketplace a year (must be approved by admin)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":658275,"PostDate":1239983964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>unikphoto<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thank you Alyssa,<br \/> <br \/> Okay, so I did get it right, I'm clear on compulsory pay for ALL vendors, that's clear now.<br \/> <br \/> What's still not quite clear is if plain \"vendors\" need to pay $150, then how much does a \"platinum\" vendor have to pay?, I seem to get lost on the fine print...lol.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks again!<br \/> marTin<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi Martin,<br \/> <br \/> Please see the rules for platinum vendors copied from above, note the request to send an email about rates and availability.<br \/> <strong>Platinum vendor:<\/strong><ul><li>must pay for button ad (email <a href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a> for rates and available spots)<\/li> <li>get added to the \"BDW Platinum Vendor Directory\"<\/li> <li>are allowed to put their website & blog links, 1 pic, & info in their siggy<\/li> <li>get to run 3 promos\/ads in vendor marketplace a year (must be approved by admin)<\/li> <\/ul>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carlydorazio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.92.56.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177534500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207375.jpg?_r=1414982962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"boscobel","Id":207375,"Name":"boscobel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5d862235d5253822b911098d94560ee","RawContent":"thanks mods...\n \n martin, they are correct...we only have a limited amount of space for platinum members but we think that this will really cut down on the waiting list we had for promotions.","Attachments":[],"Id":658554,"PostDate":1239995945,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                thanks mods...<br \/> <br \/> martin, they are correct...we only have a limited amount of space for platinum members but we think that this will really cut down on the waiting list we had for promotions.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137209820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7098e7a3e8d069ed3c9494b706b1972","RawContent":"&lt;font color=\"Blue\"&gt;Ok, thank you, I&#039;ll send an e-mail to the e-mail you say. Sooo many new things &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile72.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile72\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; I&#039;m sure this will help other vendors, cause some of us are a little freaked out about all these changes. Well, hope it works well for us all! &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;carly&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi Martin,\n \n Please see the rules for platinum vendors copied from above, note the request to send an email about rates and availability.\n &lt;strong&gt;Platinum vendor:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;must pay for button ad (email &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com\"&gt;ads@bestdestinationwedding.com&lt;\/a&gt; for rates and available spots)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;get added to the &amp;quot;BDW Platinum Vendor Directory&amp;quot;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;are allowed to put their website &amp;amp; blog links, 1 pic, &amp;amp; info in their siggy&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;get to run 3 promos\/ads in vendor marketplace a year (must be approved by admin)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":659318,"PostDate":1240074246,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <font color=\"Blue\">Ok, thank you, I'll send an e-mail to the e-mail you say. Sooo many new things <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile72.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile72\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> I'm sure this will help other vendors, cause some of us are a little freaked out about all these changes. Well, hope it works well for us all! <\/font><div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>carly<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Martin,<br \/> <br \/> Please see the rules for platinum vendors copied from above, note the request to send an email about rates and availability.<br \/> <strong>Platinum vendor:<\/strong><ul><li>must pay for button ad (email <a href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a> for rates and available spots)<\/li> <li>get added to the \"BDW Platinum Vendor Directory\"<\/li> <li>are allowed to put their website & blog links, 1 pic, & info in their siggy<\/li> <li>get to run 3 promos\/ads in vendor marketplace a year (must be approved by admin)<\/li> <\/ul><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"unikphoto@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1200425040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208244.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"unikphoto","Id":208244,"Name":"unikphoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65e9d692582e99dfa6131b466f12f4d0","RawContent":"Quick question. Sol &amp;amp; I are both members and will be purchasing a membership. Since we are 2 individuals representing only 1 vendor, how does this work for us? Will we be required to register as 2 vendors?\n \n Should I upgrade within my CP and her do the same? My thought is it may require 2 payments and your upgrade verbiage suggests that each &amp;quot;vendor&amp;quot; must upgrade... Any thoughts that might help?\n \n Gracias,\n mateo","Attachments":[],"Id":660823,"PostDate":1240239275,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Quick question. Sol & I are both members and will be purchasing a membership. Since we are 2 individuals representing only 1 vendor, how does this work for us? Will we be required to register as 2 vendors?<br \/> <br \/> Should I upgrade within my CP and her do the same? My thought is it may require 2 payments and your upgrade verbiage suggests that each \"vendor\" must upgrade... Any thoughts that might help?<br \/> <br \/> Gracias,<br \/> mateo\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175004840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b7b106752b785327ac1f8d637b71a38","RawContent":"I would think that since you both have different vendor accounts, you would need to pay accordingly.","Attachments":[],"Id":660858,"PostDate":1240240301,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I would think that since you both have different vendor accounts, you would need to pay accordingly.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tmooney74@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1148663520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206746.jpg?_r=1394162525","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":184,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyB","Id":206746,"Name":"TammyB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec8f6a7fa7a0a6fedf21c72b662c4466","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;TammyB&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I would think that since you both have different vendor accounts, you would need to pay accordingly.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;We can completely respect that, however the verbiage suggested each vendor had upgrade. Its easy enough to confuse vendor = individual business. \n \n Either way, we are happy to be members, back in the old days when it was free and in the new days when it costs :) We think its a great decision for BDWF and everyone involved here.\n \n saludos,\n mateo","Attachments":[],"Id":660925,"PostDate":1240242970,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>TammyB<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I would think that since you both have different vendor accounts, you would need to pay accordingly.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>We can completely respect that, however the verbiage suggested each vendor had upgrade. Its easy enough to confuse vendor = individual business. <br \/> <br \/> Either way, we are happy to be members, back in the old days when it was free and in the new days when it costs <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We think its a great decision for BDWF and everyone involved here.<br \/> <br \/> saludos,<br \/> mateo\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175004840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc36f5f541af76217709d81e0a68cfc5","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Matt Adcock&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;We can completely respect that, however the verbiage suggested each vendor had upgrade. Its easy enough to confuse vendor = individual business. \n \n Either way, we are happy to be members, back in the old days when it was free and in the new days when it costs :) We think its a great decision for BDWF and everyone involved here.\n \n saludos,\n mateo&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Matt - i agree that for you two this could be confusing - i am with TammyB that i think if you want 2 seperate vendor accounts then you would pay for each BUT if you and Sol want to use 1 acct then you could share it.&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;strong&gt;let&#039;s wait to hear Tammy Host&#039;s final say on this one! :)&lt;\/strong&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":660927,"PostDate":1240243100,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Matt Adcock<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">We can completely respect that, however the verbiage suggested each vendor had upgrade. Its easy enough to confuse vendor = individual business. <br \/> <br \/> Either way, we are happy to be members, back in the old days when it was free and in the new days when it costs <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We think its a great decision for BDWF and everyone involved here.<br \/> <br \/> saludos,<br \/> mateo<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><strong>Matt - i agree that for you two this could be confusing - i am with TammyB that i think if you want 2 seperate vendor accounts then you would pay for each BUT if you and Sol want to use 1 acct then you could share it.<\/strong><br \/> <strong>let's wait to hear Tammy Host's final say on this one! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/strong>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alyssa.brantley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1182295860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207483.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Alyssa","Id":207483,"Name":"Alyssa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c41225ba252fe151a8f62c053d2aee46","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Alyssa&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Matt - i agree that for you two this could be confusing - i am with TammyB that i think if you want 2 separate vendor accounts then you would pay for each BUT if you and Sol want to use 1 acct then you could share it.&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;strong&gt;let&#039;s wait to hear Tammy Host&#039;s final say on this one! :)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;We think membership here is a pretty valuable resource and thank mods for not booting us out so far up to this point .... I think Tammy could get $500 per year per vendor, for sure! We love U guys!\n \n BDWF is an amazing resource. The work done by moderators and founder and the Wright Travel agency is priceless for vendors here!\n \n Saludos,\n matt","Attachments":[],"Id":661997,"PostDate":1240285895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Alyssa<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\"><strong>Matt - i agree that for you two this could be confusing - i am with TammyB that i think if you want 2 separate vendor accounts then you would pay for each BUT if you and Sol want to use 1 acct then you could share it.<\/strong><br \/> <strong>let's wait to hear Tammy Host's final say on this one! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/strong><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>We think membership here is a pretty valuable resource and thank mods for not booting us out so far up to this point .... I think Tammy could get $500 per year per vendor, for sure! We love U guys!<br \/> <br \/> BDWF is an amazing resource. The work done by moderators and founder and the Wright Travel agency is priceless for vendors here!<br \/> <br \/> Saludos,<br \/> matt\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175004840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":68,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
