> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"941fa59b7b858ffd31b61997ab159f24","RawContent":"HI katya, \n \n As luck would have it I just came on and found this post from you after I emailed you about pricing lol! \n My fiance and I were wondering about this recent change in policy for Larimar, but your post clarified that we can at least STILL BRING someone in (it will just cost us some extra money). \n \n Thank you, and I am sure you hear this lots, but your work is amazing! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KatyaNova[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi ladies!!  \n \n We&#039;ve worked with Now Larimar on a number of weddings and they always do a fabulous job. This resort has some of the best wedding planners around! I love that there&#039;s the Now Larimar and the Secrets Royal Beach sides. Your guests can choose where they prefer to stay and both sides are very accommodating. It&#039;s also awesome that there are no bracelets. The resort is fairly small, it&#039;s easy to get around and connect with all your wedding guests. It&#039;s the perfect choice!!! \n \n Just to let you know, they have recently changed the &#039;outside vendor&#039; policy and it&#039;s now $500 to bring your own photographer\/videographer team. Rob &amp;amp; I do both photo &amp;amp; video and have a special deal for our Now Larimar brides - we pay half of this fee for you (or simply give you a $250 reduction on your favourite Collection). From the perspective of both a photographer AND a recent bride, I invite you to do your homework and make sure you absolutely love whomever you hire to document your love!!  \n \n Here&#039;s some eye candy from our recent wedding there...  \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197875\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197876\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197877\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197879\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197884\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img] \n \n For more, check out these other weddings:  \n \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/[\/url] \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/[\/url] \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/[\/url] \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/samantha-travis-now-larimar-engagement-punta-cana-dr\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/samantha-travis-now-larimar-engagement-punta-cana-dr\/[\/url] \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-jen-jack\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-jen-jack\/[\/url] \n \n I&#039;m here for you if you have any questions about the place!!!  \n \n Hugs from Punta Cana,  \n \n Katya.  \n [email=\"katya@katyanova.com?subject=hello&#33;\"]katya@katyanova.com[\/email][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1749244,"PostDate":1366583820,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> HI katya,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As luck would have it I just came on and found this post from you after I emailed you about pricing lol!<\/p> <p> My fiance and I were wondering about this recent change in policy for Larimar, but your post clarified that we can at least STILL BRING someone in (it will just cost us some extra money).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you, and I am sure you hear this lots, but your work is amazing!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KatyaNova<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi ladies!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We've worked with Now Larimar on a number of weddings and they always do a fabulous job. This resort has some of the best wedding planners around! I love that there's the Now Larimar and the Secrets Royal Beach sides. Your guests can choose where they prefer to stay and both sides are very accommodating. It's also awesome that there are no bracelets. The resort is fairly small, it's easy to get around and connect with all your wedding guests. It's the perfect choice!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Just to let you know, they have recently changed the 'outside vendor' policy and it's now $500 to bring your own photographer\/videographer team. Rob & I do both photo & video and have a special deal for our Now Larimar brides - we pay half of this fee for you (or simply give you a $250 reduction on your favourite Collection). From the perspective of both a photographer AND a recent bride, I invite you to do your homework and make sure you absolutely love whomever you hire to document your love!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here's some eye candy from our recent wedding there...\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1365450354555_1921\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"197875\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197875\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"197876\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197876\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"197877\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197877\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1365450354555_8381\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"197879\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197879\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"197884\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197884\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For more, check out these other weddings:\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin: 0px\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...g-taylor-scott\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"margin: 0px\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...her-laura-jeff\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"margin: 0px\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...ing-punta-cana\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"m