\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I received my confirmation. We are getting married on April 9, 2014 at 4. My wedding coordinator is Luisa!<\/p> <p> Did you guys confirm the location of the wedding already? and the reception location?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mjouellette0@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.118.194.63","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1361221826,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266253.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJ Ouellette","Id":266253,"Name":"MJ Ouellette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7c4f070e364bda807bc337fff190fc4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats MJ! I do have the confirmation of both my ceremony and reception. I chose the locations when I sent in the wedding request forms.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1749947,"PostDate":1366736672,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats MJ! I do have the confirmation of both my ceremony and reception. I chose the locations when I sent in the wedding request forms.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357853578,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d0cefb3d0327d9b3137796ea4daf082","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yup we&#039;re getting married at Now in March 2014! Super excited!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1750063,"PostDate":1366749542,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yup we're getting married at Now in March 2014! Super excited!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lzpast@outlook.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366582569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268833.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lzpast","Id":268833,"Name":"lzpast","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96b8bad00db5a5395af3380b08c8fff8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats Izpast!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have a question for all of you, I notice that the prices for the wedding packages are for 2012-2013 on the Now Larimar Website, did you guys receive the prices for 2014? I&#039;m hoping there won&#039;t be a big difference for 2014...! Keeping my fingers crossed!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The only thing I received were the prices for the \"Additional Services\".&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks !! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1750386,"PostDate":1366818775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats Izpast!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have a question for all of you, I notice that the prices for the wedding packages are for 2012-2013 on the Now Larimar Website, did you guys receive the prices for 2014? I'm hoping there won't be a big difference for 2014...! Keeping my fingers crossed!<\/p> <p> The only thing I received were the prices for the \"Additional Services\".<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks !! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mjouellette0@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.118.194.63","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1361221826,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266253.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJ Ouellette","Id":266253,"Name":"MJ Ouellette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc432447b5469fcfe4a4b7dd294ddfe6","RawContent":"MJ, I asked my wedding coordinator that question specifically and she said that for now the prices have not changed. But in small print it says there prices are subject to change without notice. I&#039;ve already paid my deposit but I am anticipating an increase for sure.","Attachments":[],"Id":1750405,"PostDate":1366821847,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                MJ, I asked my wedding coordinator that question specifically and she said that for now the prices have not changed. But in small print it says there prices are subject to change without notice. I've already paid my deposit but I am anticipating an increase for sure.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357853578,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1003c6c5405758021695119c964f1522","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I thought the same thing when we booked. I hope that by paying our depost it locks in the price quoted to us. Has anyone heard any feed back about the salon and spa, I just reserved the Bridal suite for the day of our wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1750740,"PostDate":1366896413,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I thought the same thing when we booked. I hope that by paying our depost it locks in the price quoted to us. Has anyone heard any feed back about the salon and spa, I just reserved the Bridal suite for the day of our wedding.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.kemp@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365690404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268451.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda15012014","Id":268451,"Name":"amanda15012014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5345b63dd4062e836caa379602b1ba5e","RawContent":"How do you reserve the suite? How much is it? I&#039;ve only heard about it from trip advisor. But wasn&#039;t sure how to go about it. I&#039;ve heard good things about their salon. They use MAC products. And pretty good feedback about the hair too. Again this is all from reading online, nobody I know personally.","Attachments":[],"Id":1750745,"PostDate":1366896800,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                How do you reserve the suite? How much is it? I've only heard about it from trip advisor. But wasn't sure how to go about it. I've heard good things about their salon. They use MAC products. And pretty good feedback about the hair too. Again this is all from reading online, nobody I know personally.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357853578,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simm