size=\"2\" style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><strong>Sladjana Cvetinovic<\/strong><\/span><\/font><br \/> <a href='mailto:spa.serpc@secretsresorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><font face=\"Verdana,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 9pt\">spa1.serpc@secretsresorts.com<\/span><\/font><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We definitely recommend you their services! We saw here a lot of brides completely happy with the services!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"weddings@wbastudio.com","IpAddress":"186.6.222.235","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1350732995,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261572.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WBA Weddings","Id":261572,"Name":"WBA Weddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f771002df0dcc2db3886d73f118f804","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi love this website. Just booked for April 2014 - got plenty of time before then to read up on the important tips on here :-)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Trying to decide on a colour theme as we speak!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1757228,"PostDate":1368435158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                