{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50893f94abc209492e48abaaf34c5020","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Kristina,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was just reading through some material I received from my wedding coordinator and I can confirm to you that cost is $500 USD per person for outside photography and the hotel notes that it does not include food or beverage.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hope that helps but I&#039;m guessing it&#039;s not the answer you would have liked :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1770319,"PostDate":1371658352,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Kristina,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was just reading through some material I received from my wedding coordinator and I can confirm to you that cost is $500 USD per person for outside photography and the hotel notes that it does not include food or beverage.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope that helps but I'm guessing it's not the answer you would have liked <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carolynbrown_83@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"204.50.151.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371065914,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270532.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Carolyn B","Id":270532,"Name":"Carolyn B","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78d34603051464d98e4b131c5cebf944","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Duchovny, the other properties were Melia Caribe, Oceans Blue &amp;amp; Sand and Grand Bahia.&amp;nbsp; Too bad it wasn&#039;t the other two you were considering.&amp;nbsp; I have friends that stayed at Dreams on a family vacation this past February and they loved it so much they bought time share :) They saw a lot of weddings there - I think they&#039;re all gorgeous and your wedding will be fantastic no matter which one you pick.&amp;nbsp; We fell in love with Now Larimar on our site inspection but I fell in love with their wedding packages prior to visiting. Congrats on your wedding!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1770323,"PostDate":1371658614,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Duchovny, the other properties were Melia Caribe, Oceans Blue & Sand and Grand Bahia.\u00a0 Too bad it wasn't the other two you were considering.\u00a0 I have friends that stayed at Dreams on a family vacation this past February and they loved it so much they bought time share <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> They saw a lot of weddings there - I think they're all gorgeous and your wedding will be fantastic no matter which one you pick.\u00a0 We fell in love with Now Larimar on our site inspection but I fell in love with their wedding packages prior to visiting. Congrats on your wedding!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carolynbrown_83@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"204.50.151.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371065914,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270532.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Carolyn B","Id":270532,"Name":"Carolyn B","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22acacbcedec9836ed98faf38556f983","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Kristina Simms[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Has anyone asked their wedding coordinator how the outside vendor fee works? I am wondering specifically about an outside photographer that is a team of two ppl, is that still the straight $500 for the company or are we required to pay per person?[\/quote] \n Hi Kristina!!  \n \n The $500 fee is per photography TEAM. My husband Rob &amp;amp; I work together and it&#039;s just a flat fee for us. We offer to take care of half the fee for our couples[img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/angel2.gif[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1770632,"PostDate":1371731914,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Kristina Simms<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Has anyone asked their wedding coordinator how the outside vendor fee works? I am wondering specifically about an outside photographer that is a team of two ppl, is that still the straight $500 for the company or are we required to pay per person?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hi Kristina!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The $500 fee is per photography TEAM. My husband Rob & I work together and it's just a flat fee for us. We offer to take care of half the fee for our couples<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1371760712711_1617\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/angel2.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kzheleznova@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"61.19.236.122","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1261897745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224102.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KatyaNova","Id":224102,"Name":"KatyaNova","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be439f399d979e99372fa222335ecdd6","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Carolyn B[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Kristina, \n \n I was just reading through some material I received from my wedding coordinator and I can confirm to you that cost is $500 USD per person for outside photography and the hotel notes that it does not include food or beverage. \n \n Hope that helps but I&#039;m guessing it&#039;s not the answer you would have liked :([\/quote] \n Sorry love, NOT true. It&#039;s per photography TEAM. On top of that, if your photographers are covering your reception dinner, you would be expected to seat &amp;amp; feed us... that&#039;s just standard. There you go! Hugs from here :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1770636,"PostDate":1371732104,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Carolyn B<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Kristina,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was just reading through some material I received from my wedding coordinator and I can confirm to you that cost is $500 USD per person for outside photography and the hotel notes that it does not include food or beverage.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope that helps but I'm guessing it's not the answer you would have liked <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Sorry love, NOT true. It's per photography TEAM. On top of that, if your photographers are covering your reception dinner, you would be expected to seat & feed us... that's just standard. There you go! Hugs from here <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kzheleznova@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"61.19.236.122","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1261897745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224102.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KatyaNova","Id":224102,"Name":"KatyaNova","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61c97a76da3ffb180df204546a92fbb9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; KatyaNova,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am planning on getting married on May 2nd or 3rd, 2014 at Now Larimar in the beautiful Punta Cana!! I am very interested in getting a photographer other than the one they provide you with at the resort. How much do you and your husband charge??&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1770770,"PostDate":1371747910,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> KatyaNova,<\/p> <p> I am planning on getting married on May 2nd or 3rd, 2014 at Now Larimar in the beautiful Punta Cana!! I am very interested in getting a photographer other than the one they provide you with at the resort. How much do you and your husband charge??\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mary_mac0203@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368571281,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269591.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marbear0503","Id":269591,"Name":"Marbear0503","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6c3062c3f9017e930ce38ee2b043d42","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just got off the phone with the Now Larimar... I had not heard from Silvia in over a week... I was informed that she is no longer with them, and I have a new Coordinator whom I spoke with and she told me she had many e-mails and she would reply to my e-mail in 24 to 48 hours its already been over a week since I had e-mailed her... Is anyone else having this problem...\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1773542,"PostDate":1372440806,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just got off the phone with the Now Larimar... I had not heard from Silvia in over a week... I was informed that she is no longer with them, and I have a new Coordinator whom I spoke with and she told me she had many e-mails and she would reply to my e-mail in 24 to 48 hours its already been over a week since I had e-mailed her... Is anyone else having this problem...<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lkibler2@perry.k12.ny.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371413551,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270637.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kacey0829","Id":270637,"Name":"Kacey0829","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"178074885bd4f6bf31b00f0afab67744","RawContent":"Hey Kacey. My travel agent did tell me she was having the same problem. Something about the WC having issues with her computer. She called them today and that&#039;s what she was told, but she originally sent in my request last week. So yes it&#039;s taking forever!","Attachments":[],"Id":1773567,"PostDate":1372447567,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Kacey. My travel agent did tell me she was having the same problem. Something about the WC having issues with her computer. She called them today and that's what she was told, but she originally sent in my request last week. So yes it's taking forever!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5841f33bb368ee8159ca528043251b9","RawContent":"I&#039;m looking to book at Now Larimar for 12\/13\/14 and love everything I&#039;ve heard and seen about the resort! Except I was looking to have my reception at Castaways but it now says there&#039;s a $5000 fee to reserve!!! ( so upsetting) I emailed the resort to inquire about this issue but I haven&#039;t heard anything back yet!","Attachments":[],"Id":1773679,"PostDate":1372498014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm looking to book at Now Larimar for 12\/13\/14 and love everything I've heard and seen about the resort! Except I was looking to have my reception at Castaways but it now says there's a $5000 fee to reserve!!! ( so upsetting) I emailed the resort to inquire about this issue but I haven't heard anything back yet!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vgarcia0788@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368989702,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269745.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bride473473","Id":269745,"Name":"bride473473","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a159524943704f0ef6efd41d4acad4b9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; hey! When is your wedding ?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1773830,"PostDate":1372547616,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> hey! When is your wedding ?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marlena.pawul@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362616447,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267003.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ilovegreg","Id":267003,"Name":"ilovegreg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":nul