body>\r\n                <p> Sweet! Are you using a travel agent? How many people are you expecting to come?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90c12445cb68f52f3219e76930ccfc2c","RawContent":"Yes we are using a travel agent and we are expecting 20 to 25 people. How many people are you expecting?","Attachments":[],"Id":1775780,"PostDate":1373115581,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes we are using a travel agent and we are expecting 20 to 25 people. How many people are you expecting?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberk90@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372755645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271117.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberk90","Id":271117,"Name":"amberk90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b24c6ef3929cc0365a00f76de11b4d0","RawContent":"We&#039;re probably going to have between 50 and 60, most if not all of them will stay at the resort. As a business owner I&#039;d be responding to emails constantly to get the amount of people we&#039;re bringing. I&#039;ve started to look at other possible locations just in case. I&#039;m not a last minute person.","Attachments":[],"Id":1775818,"PostDate":1373126342,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We're probably going to have between 50 and 60, most if not all of them will stay at the resort. As a business owner I'd be responding to emails constantly to get the amount of people we're bringing. I've started to look at other possible locations just in case. I'm not a last minute person.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9df295e5f8c2d4e85eab85fd226a7169","RawContent":"Hey Ladies, I&#039;m also waiting on confirmation for May 2014. They actually did respond quite quickly and told me my date was available - at first. That was before I explained that I want a legal service and need the judge. Now it&#039;s been over a week and I haven&#039;t heard back and my travel agent has contacted them several times. Trying not to stress out though.... realistically, there&#039;s plenty of time. I just have to keep reminding myself that, lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":1775848,"PostDate":1373134579,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Ladies, I'm also waiting on confirmation for May 2014. They actually did respond quite quickly and told me my date was available - at first. That was before I explained that I want a legal service and need the judge. Now it's been over a week and I haven't heard back and my travel agent has contacted them several times. Trying not to stress out though.... realistically, there's plenty of time. I just have to keep reminding myself that, lol.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tamika_nicole@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.129.78.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373133131,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271242.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DestiBride","Id":271242,"Name":"DestiBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"278c9f29b398e1cf319b4c5b8bf5bb08","RawContent":"I&#039;m not a last minute person either so it&#039;s pretty stressful waiting. I read alot of reviews that said its slow in the beginning but closer to your wedding date they really get in touch alot sooner so once we just get a confirmation I will be ok it&#039;s just the waiting that&#039;s hard.","Attachments":[],"Id":1775867,"PostDate":1373140875,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm not a last minute person either so it's pretty stressful waiting. I read alot of reviews that said its slow in the beginning but closer to your wedding date they really get in touch alot sooner so once we just get a confirmation I will be ok it's just the waiting that's hard.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberk90@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372755645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271117.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberk90","Id":271117,"Name":"amberk90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22cd5deb3f612807a4ccb88081ae6138","RawContent":"Finally! I got a reply from NOW confirming the availability of 8\/30\/2014 for a symbolic ceremony! I&#039;m so pumped. The wedding coordinator who sent me the information is as follows: Sladjana Cvetinovic Wedding cordinator Now Larimar\/Secrets Resorts &amp; Spa Bavaro Punta Cana, DOMINICAN_REPUBLIC T. 809-221-4646 Ext. 7422 weddings4.nolpc@nowresorts.com Hopefully this helps the brides who are still awaiting contact. Now I can get to planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1776930,"PostDate":1373449405,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Finally! I got a reply from NOW confirming the availability of 8\/30\/2014 for a symbolic ceremony! I'm so pumped. The wedding coordinator who sent me the information is as follows: Sladjana Cvetinovic Wedding cordinator Now Larimar\/Secrets Resorts & Spa Bavaro Punta Cana, DOMINICAN_REPUBLIC T. 809-221-4646 Ext. 7422 weddings4.nolpc@nowresorts.com Hopefully this helps the brides who are still awaiting contact. Now I can get to planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"336e0e22502da7515bc9ffa9a47bdec8","RawContent":"That&#039;s so exciting and such a relief!","Attachments":[],"Id":1777071,"PostDate":1373464920,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                That's so exciting and such a relief!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberk90@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372755645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271117.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberk90","Id":271117,"Name":"amberk90","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":460,"TotalPages":46,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":90,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":450},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
