{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75ab852d0f6384f9b9f1ad39a9840717","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Marbear0503[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n KatyaNova, \n I am planning on getting married on May 2nd or 3rd, 2014 at Now Larimar in the beautiful Punta Cana!! I am very interested in getting a photographer other than the one they provide you with at the resort. How much do you and your husband charge??[\/quote] \n Hey love!  \n Ah, I&#039;m so disappointed we&#039;ll be in Italy for a wedding and aren&#039;t coming back till May 4th... We could fly back a day earlier for you if the 4th of May works for you! Please shoot me an email katya@katyanova.com or send me a private message and we&#039;ll figure it out! xoxo","Attachments":[],"Id":1777147,"PostDate":1373474678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Marbear0503<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> KatyaNova,<\/p> <p> I am planning on getting married on May 2nd or 3rd, 2014 at Now Larimar in the beautiful Punta Cana!! I am very interested in getting a photographer other than the one they provide you with at the resort. How much do you and your husband charge??\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hey love!\u00a0<\/p> <p> Ah, I'm so disappointed we'll be in Italy for a wedding and aren't coming back till May 4th... We could fly back a day earlier for you if the 4th of May works for you! Please shoot me an email katya@katyanova.com or send me a private message and we'll figure it out! xoxo<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kzheleznova@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"61.19.236.122","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1261897745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224102.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KatyaNova","Id":224102,"Name":"KatyaNova","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cab6d5ef92f060209be5f57854ff1d3b","RawContent":"@Kristina SImms Hi there. I hired an outside photographer Phil Steingard; however, I also got my free photos from my wedding package with WBA. WBA did do my VIDEO and it tirned out great","Attachments":[],"Id":1777890,"PostDate":1373636679,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @Kristina SImms Hi there. I hired an outside photographer Phil Steingard; however, I also got my free photos from my wedding package with WBA. WBA did do my VIDEO and it tirned out great\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"opa1papi@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1354825217,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263022.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Paolalindsay","Id":263022,"Name":"Paolalindsay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87b9359bcac69caabc46ba383dc7ddfd","RawContent":"We finally got a reply that our requested date of May 14, 2014 is available!!! I am so excited that we finally have an answer! I cant wait to start planning wedding details! I want to hear everyone else&#039;s plans or wedding details if it already happened(congratulations!) also please post pics!","Attachments":[],"Id":1778008,"PostDate":1373662215,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We finally got a reply that our requested date of May 14, 2014 is available!!! I am so excited that we finally have an answer! I cant wait to start planning wedding details! I want to hear everyone else's plans or wedding details if it already happened(congratulations!) also please post pics!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberk90@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372755645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271117.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberk90","Id":271117,"Name":"amberk90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"958c8e9c2b5ff2e238e3679bc042fb8f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello all, I have been looking at Now larimar punta cana and dreams la romana, Im swaying slightly towards Now.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have been looking at their wedding guide and Im a little confused with their prices, so if anyone could shed some light on the Now wedding prices I would greatly appreciate it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My confusion has come from page 11 of the wedding guide &#039;additional wedding services&#039; I see all items listed through out the guide states $ however on page 11 it shows &amp;nbsp;a few items, such as the fire dancers as US$. Does that mean that all the other prices are actually RD$\/dominican pesos $?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Or are all prices USD$?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also on another note, can anyone shed some light on the outside vendor photography fee? I have a very close friend who is also a photographer. I have invited him to the wedding as a guest and also asked him to do the photography. Since he is also going to be a wedding guest he will be staying with us at the hotel so would the outside vendor fee apply to him to do the photography?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Any info on these anyone has will be greatly appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; ;-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1778293,"PostDate":1373785183,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello all, I have been looking at Now larimar punta cana and dreams la romana, Im swaying slightly towards Now.<\/p> <p> I have been looking at their wedding guide and Im a little confused with their prices, so if anyone could shed some light on the Now wedding prices I would greatly appreciate it.<\/p> <p> My confusion has come from page 11 of the wedding guide 'additional wedding services' I see all items listed through out the guide states $ however on page 11 it shows \u00a0a few items, such as the fire dancers as US$. Does that mean that all the other prices are actually RD$\/dominican pesos $?\u00a0<\/p> <p> Or are all prices USD$?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also on another note, can anyone shed some light on the outside vendor photography fee? I have a very close friend who is also a photographer. I have invited him to the wedding as a guest and also asked him to do the photography. Since he is also going to be a wedding guest he will be staying with us at the hotel so would the outside vendor fee apply to him to do the photography?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Any info on these anyone has will be greatly appreciated.<\/p> <p> ;-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"topbanana1985@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"94.14.35.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373784497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271520.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chel","Id":271520,"Name":"chel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd49a603c5788100d780edeae3327d4c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]amberk90[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n We finally got a reply that our requested date of May 14, 2014 is available!!! I am so excited that we finally have an answer! I cant wait to start planning wedding details! I want to hear everyone else&#039;s plans or wedding details if it already happened(congratulations!) also please post pics![\/quote] \n CONGRATULATIONS on locking down your date, lady! The hard part is over :) Hope these pictures help you, here are a few of our latest weddings that we&#039;ve done at Now Larimar...  \n [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/samantha-travis-now-larimar-engagement-punta-cana-dr\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/samantha-travis-now-larimar-engagement-punta-cana-dr\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-jen-jack\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-jen-jack\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-lindsay-marko\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-lindsay-marko\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-jellyfish-wedding-megan-tey\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-jellyfish-wedding-megan-tey\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n Let me know if you have any questions about the place! xoxo Katya [\/size][\/font]","Attachments":[],"Id":1780770,"PostDate":1374307701,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>amberk90<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> We finally got a reply that our requested date of May 14, 2014 is available!!! I am so excited that we finally have an answer! I cant wait to start planning wedding details! I want to hear everyone else's plans or wedding details if it already happened(congratulations!) also please post pics!<\/blockquote> <p> CONGRATULATIONS on locking down your date, lady! The hard part is over <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Hope these pictures help you, here are a few of our latest weddings that we've done at Now Larimar...\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...g-taylor-scott\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...her-laura-jeff\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...ing-punta-cana\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/samantha-travis-now-larimar-engagement-punta-cana-dr\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...-punta-cana-dr\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-jen-jack\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...dding-jen-jack\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-lindsay-marko\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...-lindsay-marko\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-jellyfish-wedding-megan-tey\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...ding-megan-tey\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> Let me know if you have any questions about the place! xoxo Katya\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kzheleznova@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"61.19.236.122","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1261897745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224102.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KatyaNova","Id":224102,"Name":"KatyaNova","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3bfe7b946b8aa436533280b6dc9299b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m not sure if you are aware but if you guests stay at another resort there is a visitor pass that you or they have to purchase to attend your wedding or get on the resort. &amp;nbsp;Just an FYI&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1780860,"PostDate":1374333666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm not sure if you are aware but if you guests stay at another resort there is a visitor pass that you or they have to purchase to attend your wedding or get on the resort. \u00a0Just an FYI<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlstockslager@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.59.10.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369172542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269825.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jldinapoli","Id":269825,"Name":"jldinapoli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"caae537ac0811760f1768291d75eaf2b","RawContent":"Yes I do know that! Thanks so much for telling me though. Luckily all our guests are staying at the resort. How about yours?","Attachments":[],"Id":1780887,"PostDate":1374346170,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes I do know that! Thanks so much for telling me though. Luckily all our guests are staying at the resort. How about yours?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberk90@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372755645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271117.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberk90","Id":271117,"Name":"amberk90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d245df8d72592b63ac2abd14d32acd6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KatyaNova\"]\nCONGRATULATIONS on locking down your date, lady! The hard part is over :) Hope these pictures help you, here are a few of our latest weddings that we&#039;ve done at Now Larimar...  &lt;p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;\"&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;\"&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;\"&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;\"&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/samantha-travis-now-larimar-engagement-punta-cana-dr\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/samantha-travis-now-larimar-engagement-punta-cana-dr\/[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;\"&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-jen-jack\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-jen-jack\/[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;\"&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-lindsay-marko\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-lindsay-marko\/[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;\"&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-jellyfish-wedding-megan-tey\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-jellyfish-wedding-megan-tey\/[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;\"&gt;Let me know if you have any questions about the place! xoxo Katya &lt;\/p&gt;[\/quote] Your photos are beautiful! Thank you so much for sharing them! I&#039;m interested in how much your rates are and if your available may 14th 2014.. Hope to hear from you soon!","Attachments":[],"Id":1780888,"PostDate":1374346401,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"KatyaNova\" url=\"\/t\/85114\/now&#045;larimar&#045;2014&#045;brides\/60#post_1928839\"><p>CONGRATULATIONS on locking down your date, lady! The hard part is over <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Hope these pictures help you, here are a few of our latest weddings that we've done at Now Larimar...\u00a0 <p  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Helvetica\"><a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...g-taylor-scott\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Helvetica\"><a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...her-laura-jeff\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Helvetica\"><a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...ing-punta-cana\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Helvetica\"><a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/samantha-travis-now-larimar-engagement-punta-cana-dr\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...-punta-cana-dr\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Helvetica\"><a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-jen-jack\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...dding-jen-jack\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Helvetica\"><a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-lindsay-marko\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...-lindsay-marko\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Helvetica\"><a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-jellyfish-wedding-megan-tey\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...ding-megan-tey\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Helvetica\">Let me know if you have any questions about the place! xoxo Katya\u00a0<\/p><\/p><\/blockquote> Your photos are beautiful! Thank you so much for sharing them! I'm interested in how much your rates are and if your available may 14th 2014.. Hope to hear from you soon!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberk90@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372755645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271117.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberk90","Id":271117,"Name":"amberk90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"115fde6cea3d4a2d6b1867aa1618796c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]amberk90[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Your photos are beautiful! Thank you so much for sharing them! I&#039;m interested in how much your rates are and if your available may 14th 2014.. Hope to hear from you soon![\/quote] \n Thank you, love! Sending you a PM with the details :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1781036,"PostDate":1374411775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>amberk90<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Your photos are beautiful! Thank you so much for sharing them! I'm interested in how much your rates are and if your available may 14th 2014.. Hope to hear from you soon!<\/blockquote> <p> Thank you, love! Sending you a PM with the details <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kzheleznova@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"61.19.236.122","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1261897745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224102.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KatyaNova","Id":224102,"Name":"KatyaNova","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a2917b2071f8235a984b0b790f60417","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey ladies, I am glad your getting your confirmations for your wedding dates!! i just got mine last week and it did take them just over 2 weeks to confirm. But I am now confirmed for April 28th at 5pm!! I am sooo excited!! I am trying to finish designing my wedding invites so I can send them out soon so people can put down their deposits!! It&#039;s all starting to feel so real!! I bought my wedding dress from David&#039;s Bridal on July 6th and they called me on July 18th because it was ready for pick up!! Talk about fast!!! I hope every ones planning is going great!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1781886,"PostDate":1374570848,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey ladies, I am glad your getting your confirmations for your wedding dates!! i just got mine last week and it did take them just over 2 weeks to confirm. But I am now confirmed for April 28th at 5pm!! I am sooo excited!! I am trying to finish designing my wedding invites so I can send them out soon so people can put down their deposits!! It's all starting to feel so real!! I bought my wedding dress from David's Bridal on July 6th and they called me on July 18th because it was ready for pick up!! Talk about fast!!! I hope every ones planning is going great!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mary_mac0203@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368571281,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269591.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marbear0503","Id":269591,"Name":"Marbear0503","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":460,"TotalPages":46,"CurrentPage":90,"NextPage":100,"PreviousPage":80,"LastPage":450},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
