{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.244.31.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1389806119,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b3fdf20db65a3343041bd56e3056662","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;@[member=\"duchovny0901\"] You make me feel soooooooooooo far behind. LOL! &lt;em&gt;My wedding coordinator&#039;s name is Yohannelly.&lt;\/em&gt; Im going with a tangerine orange and deep purple color. Id like my bridesmaids dresses to be orange with a purple and orange bouquet. Id like the grooms to wear tan color linen suits with orange ties and a purple and orange boutonierre. I decided to use&amp;nbsp;the photographer at the resort.I just could not bring myself to pay an additional $500 for an outside vendor fee.&amp;nbsp;What made you go with the fountain? Are you getting the full fountain setup as well? As far as DJ&#039;s go, I dont know if I want to use DJ Mannia (Ive heard good things about him) or the resort dj. My wedding coordinator&#039;s name is &lt;em&gt;Yohannelly. I have tried on dresses, but have not found \"the one\" yet. I have another appt on the 1st of February. **fingers crossed** &lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Oh yeah! And great idea on the silk flowers. I may have to do that!!! WHat are you guys doing for hair and makeup? I think I may have to go with the hotel salon.&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826335,"PostDate":1389806064,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><em>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a> You make me feel soooooooooooo far behind. LOL! <em>My wedding coordinator's name is Yohannelly.<\/em> Im going with a tangerine orange and deep purple color. Id like my bridesmaids dresses to be orange with a purple and orange bouquet. Id like the grooms to wear tan color linen suits with orange ties and a purple and orange boutonierre. I decided to use\u00a0the photographer at the resort.I just could not bring myself to pay an additional $500 for an outside vendor fee.\u00a0What made you go with the fountain? Are you getting the full fountain setup as well? As far as DJ's go, I dont know if I want to use DJ Mannia (Ive heard good things about him) or the resort dj. My wedding coordinator's name is <em>Yohannelly. I have tried on dresses, but have not found \"the one\" yet. I have another appt on the 1st of February. **fingers crossed** <\/em><\/em><\/p>\n<br><p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><sub>Oh yeah! And great idea on the silk flowers. I may have to do that!!! WHat are you guys doing for hair and makeup? I think I may have to go with the hotel salon.<\/sub><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sohoward82@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.244.31.111","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372592144,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271063.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsFountain2B","Id":271063,"Name":"MrsFountain2B","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba029bfa675540788bea462449e79d47","RawContent":"@[member=\"jldinapoli\"]   Thanks for your help! I ended up getting in contact with Karina so all is well. I wasn&#039;t receiving her replies, but all is well now. I&#039;m so excited for her to be our photographer, her work looks amazing! I love her photos of \"the first look\". I think I&#039;ll have to do it!\n\n\n13 days away!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1826345,"PostDate":1389807326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"269825\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/269825-jldinapoli\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jldinapoli<\/span><\/a>   Thanks for your help! I ended up getting in contact with Karina so all is well. I wasn't receiving her replies, but all is well now. I'm so excited for her to be our photographer, her work looks amazing! I love her photos of \"the first look\". I think I'll have to do it!<br><br>\n13 days away!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357853578,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c897afb3b3e8808a3b1e76a750efba7b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271063-mrsfountain2b\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;MrsFountain2B&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Don&#039;t feel so far behind! I&#039;m just so anxious to get to the wedding day! Your colors sound awesome by the way. I chose the fountain due to more privacy and the fact that I loved the way it looked when it was setup from the pics and vids. It&#039;s such a unique spot. And I am going to cringe and get the full fountain setup; u only get married once (usually, ha!) so I&#039;m going to go for it! Depending on when you&#039;d like your reception, I&#039;d ask your WC about the resort DJ. I thought I remember someone saying he&#039;d end at like 9:30 or something because he had to work in the nightclub at 10:30. That was a big factor for me going with DJ Mannia; my ceremony is at 4pm and I wanted plenty of time for pictures so our reception starts at 7pm.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And I&#039;m sure you&#039;ll find the dress! I&#039;ll keep my fingers crossed for you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273634-msjillss\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;MsJillss&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;As for hair as makeup, my sister is a beautician. Go figure! LOL. So I may not use the salon at all. And what a very tropical color theme!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/264243-kristina-simms\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Kristina Simms&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Yaaayyy I&#039;m glad you got in contact with her! Enjoy you special day and please come back and tell us all about the experience!!!! Have a safe trip!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826390,"PostDate":1389811797,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271063-mrsfountain2b\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>MrsFountain2B<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0Don't feel so far behind! I'm just so anxious to get to the wedding day! Your colors sound awesome by the way. I chose the fountain due to more privacy and the fact that I loved the way it looked when it was setup from the pics and vids. It's such a unique spot. And I am going to cringe and get the full fountain setup; u only get married once (usually, ha!) so I'm going to go for it! Depending on when you'd like your reception, I'd ask your WC about the resort DJ. I thought I remember someone saying he'd end at like 9:30 or something because he had to work in the nightclub at 10:30. That was a big factor for me going with DJ Mannia; my ceremony is at 4pm and I wanted plenty of time for pictures so our reception starts at 7pm.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And I'm sure you'll find the dress! I'll keep my fingers crossed for you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273634-msjillss\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>MsJillss<\/span><\/a>\u00a0<\/span>As for hair as makeup, my sister is a beautician. Go figure! LOL. So I may not use the salon at all. And what a very tropical color theme!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/264243-kristina-simms\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>Kristina Simms<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0Yaaayyy I'm glad you got in contact with her! Enjoy you special day and please come back and tell us all about the experience!!!! Have a safe trip!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"147.126.211.160","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4297dce2e72bd853d5892941c0be93c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"duchovny0901\"] Thanks so much. I&#039;m going to look into the silk flowers this weekend.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrsFountain2B\"] I wasn&#039;t quite sure if I wanted the salon to do my hair. My sister does hair as well, but she&#039;s also in the wedding. That might be asking for too much (but hey...I am the bride lol)!! I guess I will just play it by ear.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826395,"PostDate":1389812839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a> Thanks so much. I'm going to look into the silk flowers this weekend.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271063\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271063-mrsfountain2b\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrsFountain2B<\/span><\/a> I wasn't quite sure if I wanted the salon to do my hair. My sister does hair as well, but she's also in the wedding. That might be asking for too much (but hey...I am the bride lol)!! I guess I will just play it by ear.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsconner1983@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.173.180.132","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362999807,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267190.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jahanee Conner","Id":267190,"Name":"Jahanee Conner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"412bdda3e2b905a2d3ad3d8016454885","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey ladies how do I book the bridal suite? And do they bring food and beverages in there?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826455,"PostDate":1389824584,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey ladies how do I book the bridal suite? And do they bring food and beverages in there?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.145.103.89","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"889109d14049fbca83e4a958592d626c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"duchovny0901\" post=\"1826455\" timestamp=\"1389838984\"]\nHey ladies how do I book the bridal suite? And do they bring food and beverages in there?[\/quote]\n@[member=\"duchovny0901\"] I booked it through the spa. Asistente Spa[color=rgb(68,68,68)][font=&#039;Segoe UI&#039;] (spa1.serpc@secretsresorts.com)[\/font][\/color]\n\nThis was in the email they sent me:\n\n\"We can offer you Private Bridal Room, enjoy your day with your bridesmaids\nin a relaxing atmosphere, you can be together and have your Hair Styling,\nMake Up and dress in our private bridal room. Includes  bottle of champagne\nand tropical fruits. Price: Half-day is 150 US$. Please advise if that would\nbe fine. \"","Attachments":[],"Id":1826466,"PostDate":1389825877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>duchovny0901, on 15 January 2014 - 10:23 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey ladies how do I book the bridal suite? And do they bring food and beverages in there?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a> I booked it through the spa.\u00a0<a  class=\"\">Asistente Spa<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web Regular', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Helvetica Neue', 'BBAlpha Sans', 'S60 Sans', Arial, sans-serif;\">\u00a0(spa1.serpc@secretsresorts.com)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This was in the email they sent me:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\"We can offer you Private Bridal Room, enjoy your day with your bridesmaids<br>\nin a relaxing atmosphere, you can be together and have your Hair Styling,<br>\nMake Up and dress in our private bridal room. Includes \u00a0bottle of champagne<br>\nand tropical fruits. Price: Half-day is 150 US$. Please advise if that would<br>\nbe fine. \"<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gmontague88@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.145.103.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1379702666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273634.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":87,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MsJillss","Id":273634,"Name":"MsJillss","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"470e7a2b97eb31ac2601855941ab8a68","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273634-msjillss\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;MsJillss&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;You are awesome! Thanks so much!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826468,"PostDate":1389826033,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273634-msjillss\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>MsJillss<\/span><\/a>\u00a0You are awesome! Thanks so much!<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.6.34.221","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8922b9fe68db9c3c3ab3b6f061695b3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi brides! I&#039;m new to this forum and this is my first post! I&#039;m planning to have my DW at Now Larimar this upcoming November. I&#039;ve tried to get in contact with the resort to get their excel pricing list but I haven&#039;t heard back from them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Could one of you ladies kindly email their 2014 wedding pricing list to me at deelirious87@[member=\"gmail\"].com? Thank you in advance! Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826672,"PostDate":1389882182,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi brides! I'm new to this forum and this is my first post! I'm planning to have my DW at Now Larimar this upcoming November. I've tried to get in contact with the resort to get their excel pricing list but I haven't heard back from them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Could one of you ladies kindly email their 2014 wedding pricing list to me at deelirious87@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com? Thank you in advance! Happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerndenisewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.6.34.221","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389377905,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"deelirious","Id":275995,"Name":"deelirious","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d1b16d5f61535bc7a81cca5981f00e2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"deelirious\"] Congrats on your upcoming wedding! It took a little bit for us to hear back in the very beginning as well. The 2014 price list is the same as the 2013 (for now!). We haven&#039;t received any price changes yet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"lisamarco413\"] &amp;nbsp;I have confirmation from my WC that if you have the platinum menu, you can interchange and choose items from the silver\/gold menu. Hope that helps!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826839,"PostDate":1389915739,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275995\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275995-deelirious\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deelirious<\/span><\/a> Congrats on your upcoming wedding! It took a little bit for us to hear back in the very beginning as well. The 2014 price list is the same as the 2013 (for now!). We haven't received any price changes yet.\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273703\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273703-lisamarco413\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lisamarco413<\/span><\/a> \u00a0I have confirmation from my WC that if you have the platinum menu, you can interchange and choose items from the silver\/gold menu. Hope that helps!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357853578,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.205.68.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"38499d35bcd40c392f63e5e1cfe9c629","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lisamarco413\" post=\"1822207\" timestamp=\"1388792904\"]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial][size=3]@ [\/size][\/font][\/color][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/72769\/duchovny0901\"]duchovny0901[\/url][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial][size=3], @ [\/size][\/font][\/color][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/69282\/jahanee-conner\"]Jahanee Conner[\/url][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial][size=3], @ [\/size][\/font][\/color][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/66280\/kristina-simms\"]Kristina Simms[\/url][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial][size=3], @ [\/size][\/font][\/color][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/60190\/EVKnowsitall\"]EVKnowsitall[\/url][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial][size=3], @ [\/size][\/font][\/color][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/71683\/marbear0503\"]Marbear0503[\/url][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial][size=3], @[\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(70,70,70)][font=arial][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(70,70,70)][font=arial][size=3][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/71917\/jldinapoli\"]jldinapoli[\/url], @ meganjune, @ dr2015[\/size][\/font][\/color]\n\nHey all!\n\n[b]FOUR [\/b]months away and now the stress and anxiety are starting to set in!  Some more random questions!!\n\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4][background=transparent]1. What size sashes do they use?  Is anyone bringing their own?  Can they move then from the ceremony chairs to the reception chairs? [\/background][\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4][background=transparent] Is it doubled, ceremony and reception?[\/background][\/size][\/font][\/color]\n\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4][background=transparent]2. On the spreadsheet for the DIVINE Package, anyone know what the following items are:[\/background][\/size][\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4]       \"Lounge Area 6 pax\u201d[\/size][\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4]      \"Lighted bar\"[\/size][\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4]      \"LED light\"[\/size][\/font][\/color]\n\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4][background=transparent]3. Suggestions for cheap alternatives for pomanders?[\/background][\/size][\/font][\/color]\n\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4][background=transparent]4. [\/background][\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(51,51,51)][font=helvetica][size=3]T[\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4][background=transparent]he Do Not Disturb Honeymoon Package.  Anyone have this or know what it is\/includes?[\/background][\/size][\/font][\/color]\n\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4][background=transparent]5. [\/background][\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4][background=transparent]Does anyone know if guests can have their suits and dresses steamed\/ironed at the resort? I&#039;m sure there would be a fee for it but a few of the ladies coming keep asking and I don&#039;t have an answer![\/background][\/size][\/font][\/color]\n\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Arial][size=4][background=transparent]6.  Did anyone do fireworks at their receptions?  I havent seen any pictures of it and would love to know how it turned out![\/background][\/size][\/font][\/color]\n\n[size=4]Thanks everyone!  You have been my lifesavers![\/size][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1827021,"PostDate":1389970622,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lisamarco413, on 03 January 2014 - 07:48 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">@ <\/span><\/span><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/72769\/duchovny0901' class='bbc_url' title=''>duchovny0901<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">, @ <\/span><\/span><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/69282\/jahanee-conner' class='bbc_url' title=''>Jahanee Conner<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">, @ <\/span><\/span><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/66280\/kristina-simms' class='bbc_url' title=''>Kristina Simms<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">, @ <\/span><\/span><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/60190\/EVKnowsitall' class='bbc_url' title=''>EVKnowsitall<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">, @ <\/span><\/span><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/71683\/marbear0503' class='bbc_url' title=''>Marbear0503<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">, @<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(70,70,70)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(70,70,70)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/71917\/jldinapoli' class='bbc_url' title=''>jldinapoli<\/a>, @ meganjune, @ dr2015<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><br>\nHey all!<br><br><strong>FOUR <\/strong>months away and now the stress and anxiety are starting to set in!  Some more random questions!!<br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\">1. What size sashes do they use?  Is anyone bringing their own?  Can they move then from the ceremony chairs to the reception chairs? <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\"> Is it doubled, ceremony and reception?<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\">2. On the spreadsheet for the DIVINE Package, anyone know what the following items are:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">       \"Lounge Area 6 pax\u201d<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">      \"Lighted bar\"<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">      \"LED light\"<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\">3. Suggestions for cheap alternatives for pomanders?<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\">4. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><span  style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">T<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\">he Do Not Disturb Honeymoon Package.  Anyone have this or know what it is\/includes?<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\">5. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\">Does anyone know if guests can have their suits and dresses steamed\/ironed at the resort? I'm sure there would be a fee for it but a few of the ladies coming keep asking and I don't have an answer!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\">6.  Did anyone do fireworks at their receptions?  I havent seen any pictures of it and would love to know how it turned out!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><br><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Thanks everyone!  You have been my lifesavers!<\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlstockslager@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.59.10.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369172542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269825.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jldinapoli","Id":269825,"Name":"jldinapoli","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":460,"TotalPages":46,"CurrentPage":250,"NextPage":260,"PreviousPage":240,"LastPage":450},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
