> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":723,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1742448,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":227192,"Name":"ginamapi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227192.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1365162437,"LastPoster":{"Id":284227,"Name":"Manduski","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1901660,"PostDate":1438359374,"PostContent":"Hello Ginamapi, I'm not sure if you are still on this website or still active but would be really...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"manda.steinberg@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.117.136.50","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438358330,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Manduski","Id":284227,"Name":"Manduski","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05c15f8f8d3ebf21d57a292135188e69","RawContent":"&lt;h5 class=\"uiStreamMessage userContentWrapper\" data-ft=\"{&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;tn&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;K&amp;quot;}\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/h5&gt;  &lt;span class=\"messageBody\" data-ft=\"{&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:3}\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"userContent\"&gt;Hi Girls! I got married in October at the Hard Rock and have posted this before but just wanted to give a shout out to the people I used for photography, videography and invitations since I loved all three!.\n \n Invitations I used Marry me Designs. By far best price i found even if I tried to do them myself she was still cheaper for what I wanted. - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.marrymedesigns.com%2F&amp;amp;h=FAQHLw2qjAQFSsfHI7r6Gw0pyHbuiNziTMOOWhVRvSrd7UQ&amp;amp;s=1\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"#0000ff\"&gt;http:\/\/www.marrymedesigns.com\/&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Photography I used &lt;a data-hovercard=\"\/ajax\/hovercard\/user.php?id=509908542&amp;amp;extragetparams=%7B%22group_id%22%3A173716272754306%7D\" href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/michaelsteingard?group_id=173716272754306\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"#0000ff\"&gt;Michael Steingard&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/a&gt; who is AMAZING! My pictures are more than I could have asked for. I am a photographer so pictures for me were sooo important and his style was exactly what I wanted. Heres a peak at some of the pictures from our day. We have sooo many more that he tookbut these are what he picked for what he calls the wedding story. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.naturalanthem.com\/mikesteingard\/ginaandmikewedding\/\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"#810081\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;http:\/\/www.naturalanthem.com\/&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;wbr \/&gt;&lt;span&gt;mikesteingard\/&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;wbr \/&gt;ginaandmikewedding\/&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n and here is his website. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/michaelsteingard.com\/\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"#810081\"&gt;http:\/\/michaelsteingard.com\/&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Videography I used Chris LoBello Productions. Again the video was something that was very important to me. I knew I wanted to be able to relive that day over and over. We met Chris and Valerie at my best friends wedding and loved his work! It was like watching a tv show so we knew we had to have him come to the DR and film our wedding. Here is our wedding recap video. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/58671392\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"#0000ff\"&gt;https:\/\/vimeo.com\/58671392&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n I am in love with it!!!! And here is his website- &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.chrislobelloproductions.com%2F&amp;amp;h=7AQF1xRS5AQGsYbQXnyiVrotNDV3mi49gaS46BhmE2sPveg&amp;amp;s=1\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"#0000ff\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;http:\/\/&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;wbr \/&gt;&lt;span&gt;www.chrislobelloproductions.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;wbr \/&gt;\/&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n I also hav all the templates I created for our save the dates, pre travel brouchure and luggage tags we sent to everyone, the welcome books we gave out to everyone in the welcome bags, and the other things we put in the bags. Message me if you want any of them or have any questions! I know I felt so confused when planning and trying to figure it all out so I would love to help anyone that needs it :)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742448,"PostDate":1365162437,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <h5 class=\"uiStreamMessage userContentWrapper\" data-ft=\"{\"type\":1,\"tn\":\"K\"}\"> \u00a0<\/h5>  <span class=\"messageBody\" data-ft=\"{\"type\":3}\"><span class=\"userContent\">Hi Girls! I got married in October at the Hard Rock and have posted this before but just wanted to give a shout out to the people I used for photography, videography and invitations since I loved all three!.<br \/> <br \/> Invitations I used Marry me Designs. By far best price i found even if I tried to do them myself she was still cheaper for what I wanted. - <a href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.marrymedesigns.com%2F&h=FAQHLw2qjAQFSsfHI7r6Gw0pyHbuiNziTMOOWhVRvSrd7UQ&s=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><font color=\"#0000ff\">http:\/\/www.marrymedesigns.com\/<\/font><\/a><br \/> <br \/> Photography I used <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/michaelsteingard?group_id=173716272754306' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><font color=\"#0000ff\">Michael Steingard<\/font><\/a> who is AMAZING! My pictures are more than I could have asked for. I am a photographer so pictures for me were sooo important and his style was exactly what I wanted. Heres a peak at some of the pictures from our day. We have sooo many more that he tookbut these are what he picked for what he calls the wedding story. <a href='http:\/\/www.naturalanthem.com\/mikesteingard\/ginaandmikewedding\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><font color=\"#810081\"><span>http:\/\/www.naturalanthem.com\/<\/span><wbr \/><span>mikesteingard\/<\/span><wbr \/>ginaandmikewedding\/<\/font><\/a><br \/> and here is his website. <a href='http:\/\/michaelsteingard.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><font color=\"#810081\">http:\/\/michaelsteingard.com\/<\/font><\/a><br \/> <br \/> Videography I used Chris LoBello Productions. Again the video was something that was very important to me. I knew I wanted to be able to relive that day over and over. We met Chris and Valerie at my best friends wedding and loved his work! It was like watching a tv show so we knew we had to have him come to the DR and film our wedding. Here is our wedding recap video. <a href='https:\/\/vimeo.com\/58671392' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><font color=\"#0000ff\"><iframe src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/58671392\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"><\/iframe><\/font><\/a><br \/> I am in love with it!!!! And here is his website- <a href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.chrislobelloproductions.com%2F&h=7AQF1xRS5AQGsYbQXnyiVrotNDV3mi49gaS46BhmE2sPveg&s=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span>http:\/\/<\/span><wbr \/><span>www.chrislobelloproductions.com<\/span><wbr \/>\/<\/font><\/a><br \/> <br \/> I also hav all the templates I created for our save the dates, pre travel brouchure and luggage tags we sent to everyone, the welcome books we gave out to everyone in the welcome bags, and the other things we put in the bags. Message me if you want any of them or have any questions! I know I felt so confused when planning and trying to figure it all out so I would love to help anyone that needs it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ginamapi@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1270831518,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227192.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ginamapi","Id":227192,"Name":"ginamapi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.246.64.107","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"623faf6cac82b6f67104139662e39bde","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ginamapi\" post=\"1742448\" timestamp=\"1365176837\"]\n\t Hi Girls! I got married in October at the Hard Rock and have posted this before but just wanted to give a shout out to the people I used for photography, videography and invitations since I loved all three!.\n\nInvitations I used Marry me Designs. By far best price i found even if I tried to do them myself she was still cheaper for what I wanted. - [url=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.marrymedesigns.com%2F&amp;amp;h=FAQHLw2qjAQFSsfHI7r6Gw0pyHbuiNziTMOOWhVRvSrd7UQ&amp;amp;s=1\"]http:\/\/www.marrymedesigns.com\/[\/url]\n\nPhotography I used [url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/michaelsteingard?group_id=173716272754306\"]Michael Steingard[\/url] who is AMAZING! My pictures are more than I could have asked for. I am a photographer so pictures for me were sooo important and his style was exactly what I wanted. Heres a peak at some of the pictures from our day. We have sooo many more that he tookbut these are what he picked for what he calls the wedding story. [url=\"http:\/\/www.naturalanthem.com\/mikesteingard\/ginaandmikewedding\/\"]http:\/\/www.naturalanthem.com\/mikesteingard\/ginaandmikewedding\/[\/url]\nand here is his website. [url=\"http:\/\/michaelsteingard.com\/\"]http:\/\/michaelsteingard.com\/[\/url]\n\nVideography I used Chris LoBello Productions. Again the video was something that was very important to me. I knew I wanted to be able to relive that day over and over. We met Chris and Valerie at my best friends wedding and loved his work! It was like watching a tv show so we knew we had to have him come to the DR and film our wedding. Here is our wedding recap video. [url=\"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/58671392\"]https:\/\/vimeo.com\/58671392[\/url]\nI am in love with it!!!! And here is his website- [url=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.chrislobelloproductions.com%2F&amp;amp;h=7AQF1xRS5AQGsYbQXnyiVrotNDV3mi49gaS46BhmE2sPveg&amp;amp;s=1\"]http:\/\/www.chrislobelloproductions.com\/[\/url]\n\nI also hav all the templates I created for our save the dates, pre travel brouchure and luggage tags we sent to everyone, the welcome books we gave out to everyone in the welcome bags, and the other things we put in the bags. Message me if you want any of them or have any questions! I know I felt so confused when planning and trying to figure it all out so I would love to help anyone that needs it :)\nYou looked beautiful!!! Congrats :)\nWould you be willing to email me your template for your welcome books? I would really appreciate it. I have so many little details and that would definately help out.\n[email=\"liz_hund@hotmail.com\"]liz_hund@hotmail.com[\/email][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1830522,"PostDate":1391172641,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ginamapi, on 05 April 2013 - 11:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\t\u00a0\n<span><span>Hi Girls! I got married in October at the Hard Rock and have posted this before but just wanted to give a shout out to the people I used for photography, videography and invitations since I loved all three!.<br><br>\nInvitations I used Marry me Designs. By far best price i found even if I tried to do them myself she was still cheaper for what I wanted. - <a href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.marrymedesigns.com%2F&h=FAQHLw2qjAQFSsfHI7r6Gw0pyHbuiNziTMOOWhVRvSrd7UQ&s=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.marrymedesigns.com\/<\/a><br><br>\nPhotography I used <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/michaelsteingard?group_id=173716272754306' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Michael Steingard<\/a> who is AMAZING! My pictures are more than I could have asked for. I am a photographer so pictures for me were sooo important and his style was exactly what I wanted. Heres a peak at some of the pictures from our day. We have sooo many more that he tookbut these are what he picked for what he calls the wedding story. <a href='http:\/\/www.naturalanthem.com\/mikesteingard\/ginaandmikewedding\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span>http:\/\/www.naturalanthem.com\/<\/span><span>mikesteingard\/<\/span>ginaandmikewedding\/<\/a><br>\nand here is his website. <a href='http:\/\/michaelsteingard.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/michaelsteingard.com\/<\/a><br><br>\nVideography I used Chris LoBello Productions. Again the video was something that was very important to me. I knew I wanted to be able to relive that day over and over. We met Chris and Valerie at my best friends wedding and loved his work! It was like watching a tv show so we knew we had to have him come to the DR and film our wedding. Here is our wedding recap video. <a href='https:\/\/vimeo.com\/58671392' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/vimeo.com\/58671392<\/a><br>\nI am in love with it!!!! And here is his website- <a href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.chrislobelloproductions.com%2F&h=7AQF1xRS5AQGsYbQXnyiVrotNDV3mi49gaS46BhmE2sPveg&s=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span>http:\/\/<\/span><span>www.chrislobelloproductions.com<\/span>\/<\/a><br><br>\nI also hav all the templates I created for our save the dates, pre travel brouchure and luggage tags we sent to everyone, the welcome books we gave out to everyone in the welcome bags, and the other things we put in the bags. Message me if you want any of them or have any questions! I know I felt so confused when planning and trying to figure it all out so I would love to help anyone that needs it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><\/span>\n<p>You looked beautiful!!! Congrats <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Would you be willing to email me your template for your welcome books? I would really appreciate it. I have so many little details and that would definately help out.<\/p>\n<p><a href='mailto:liz_hund@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>liz_hund@hotmail.com<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"liz_hund@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.246.64.107","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1377097506,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272798.jpg?_r=1391090044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"liz24","Id":272798,"Name":"liz24","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0dfe7ad223a70005d8a3e1404d00027","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;ginamapi you were a beautiful bride.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1830610,"PostDate":1391182122,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>ginamapi you were a beautiful bride.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374010532,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.218.189","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2eddca729b5f86ec2fd6cf0bd50ee4a3","RawContent":"OMG loved the video!! You looked beautiful!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1830675,"PostDate":1391188491,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                OMG loved the video!! You looked beautiful!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christine.osoria@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.208.77.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373912902,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271565.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"christy531","Id":271565,"Name":"christy531","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.119.64.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"424433761134658e71baa7aa44ca1011","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Aww!&amp;nbsp; Beautiful!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1833170,"PostDate":1392130957,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Aww!\u00a0 Beautiful!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kellis_baby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.222.71.55","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1386889365,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275607.jpg?_r=1425326341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellisbaby","Id":275607,"Name":"kellisbaby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.56.233.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4aa833f6577bf38495a1facb705a6e77","RawContent":"Hi Gina,\n\nI am getting married in November 2014 at the Majestic Colonial. I need all the help I can get lol what did you put in your welcome bags for your guests??? Any advice will be extremely helpful! Your video is stunning!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1836046,"PostDate":1393609707,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Gina,<br>\nI am getting married in November 2014 at the Majestic Colonial. I need all the help I can get lol what did you put in your welcome bags for your guests??? Any advice will be extremely helpful! Your video is stunning!!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lady_e2006@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.56.233.153","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1393588149,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MCBridetobe","Id":276939,"Name":"MCBridetobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.117.136.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87fce10fe876d8f3cc21ddeb8b628514","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ginamapi,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m not sure if you are still on this website or still active but would be really interested in seeing your \"&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;I also hav all the templates I created for our save the dates, pre travel brouchure and luggage tags we sent to everyone, the welcome books we gave out to everyone in the welcome bags, and the other things we put in the bags.\"&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;As me and my fiance are just starting to plan and trying to collect as many ideas as possible.&amp;nbsp; We are planning on having ~100 people and want to put a great itinerary together.&amp;nbsp; Would love to see how you did it because your wedding looked beautiful.&amp;nbsp; Please feel free to email me at manda.bradford16@yahoo.com.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Thanks for your help&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901660,"PostDate":1438359374,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ginamapi,<\/p>\n<p>I'm not sure if you are still on this website or still active but would be really interested in seeing your \"<span><span>I also hav all the templates I created for our save the dates, pre travel brouchure and luggage tags we sent to everyone, the welcome books we gave out to everyone in the welcome bags, and the other things we put in the bags.\"<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><span>As me and my fiance are just starting to plan and trying to collect as many ideas as possible.\u00a0 We are planning on having ~100 people and want to put a great itinerary together.\u00a0 Would love to see how you did it because your wedding looked beautiful.\u00a0 Please feel free to email me at manda.bradford16@yahoo.com.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><span>Thanks for your help<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"manda.steinberg@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.117.136.50","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438358330,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Manduski","Id":284227,"Name":"Manduski","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"73538","Title":"Helpful Tips","LastPostDate":1438359374},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
